\description{
Reruns \code{arm} live on the items of a frozen \code{\link[=hr_benchmark]{hr_benchmark()}} and compares
the live runs with the frozen ones item by item. The live rerun is itself
an \code{\link[=hr_benchmark]{hr_benchmark()}} of the arm, with the frozen benchmark's split and
